The SWITCHDEV_FDB_ADD_TO_DEVICE notification writes the bridge MAC address
to the GWCA and adds a static rule to the MAC table.
The SWITCHDEV_FDB_DEL_TO_DEVICE removes the static rule from the MAC table.

